\f1\fs22 The High Elvis tapped on Chanta\'92s state room door. There were quiet giggles. He opened the door and stepped in, figured out which shoulder was probably Chanta\'92s among the limbs and torsos and feet in the air, and nudged it. The whole mass heaved and began to disassemble itself into its discrete  human-body components.\
