\f1\fs22 Chanta rubbed his forehead, then his eyes. Then, to get his bearings, he squeezed an arse-cheek\'97not his own.\
The High Elvis was in his face, or at least chanta, with bleary eyes thought it was the High Elvis.\
\'93What time is it?\'94 Chanta asked.\
\'93Dinner time.\'94\
Chanta frowned.\
\'93Four thirty,\'94 the High Elvis amended.\
\'93What? You let me sleep?\'94\
The High Elvis ignored that. \'93Something\'92s going on\'85\'94\
\'93Still?\'94\
\'93The guided tours into Ruined Castle have stopped, though it looks like there are more than a few sleep-overs. But a bunch of people have been showing up in lab coats.\'94\
Chanta sat up. \'93Johnny\'92s thing with the discs?\'94\
The High Elvis shrugged. \'93I doubt the Holy Momma\'92s project is the only one down there.\'94\
Something didn\'92t add up for Chanta. \'93They stayed for the Candid Criminal show, wearing lab coats?\'94\
\'93There\'92s an on-campus dorm for single employees.\'94\
Chanta stood and started dressing. He didn\'92t know Johnny well, but that didn\'92t stop him assessing he\'92d happily order people to work before sunrise on Christmas morning. Sarah though\'85 She\'92d have nothing to do with this. Besides, she was in a bunker with Eloise and Kathy. And Alexander. He doubted he\'92d cross paths with Johnny while rescuing Sarah.
